      "answer": "WELL-0001 is **not producing** per its latest effective status. It is recorded as active, but the production view reports not producing; the latest inspection showed a 3.2 °C temperature rise against a 15 °C threshold. It was inspected on **15 Oct 2026 at 09:45 UTC** by **Ryan Brooks** (INS-0001-0203). The inspector noted the pump jack was not moving. A context note says it was shut in from 7 Oct for planned rod-string replacement, with work expected to finish around 20 Oct; the note says no work order was yet in the maintenance system (CTX-0001-003).",
